<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 112,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 112,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Wednesday were 112,000 head, compared with the estimate of 100,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts $0.50-$1.00 per cwt lower than midsession Wednesday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    57.00 -58.50	   58.00 -59.50</p>
<p>Liberal volume		  58.00		    59.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  45.00 -47.00	   45.00 -48.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   45.50 -47.00	   45.50 -48.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    47.00 -50.00	   47.00 -51.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
